### Create a new movie
POST http://localhost:5142/api/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Inception",
  "description": "A thief enters people's dreams to steal secrets.",
  "genre": "Sci-Fi",
  "releaseYear": 2010
}

### Update Inception
PUT http://localhost:5142/api/movies/6aef362dcb3b0eeb49c73010
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Inception",
  "description": "A skilled thief enters dreams to steal information and plant ideas.",
  "genre": "Sci-Fi",
  "releaseYear": 2010
}

### Create a movie for DELETE testing
POST http://localhost:5142/api/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Delete Test Movie",
  "description": "This movie will be deleted during testing.",
  "genre": "Test",
  "releaseYear": 2026
}

### Delete test movie
DELETE http://localhost:5142/api/movies/6aef37f9e855e198f9ca07d2
